WEBVTT

00:03:59.255 --> 00:04:00.858
hatua walizopiga,

00:04:00.858 --> 00:04:02.384
na matokeo ya hizo hatua

00:04:02.384 --> 00:04:05.311
zaidi ya madaraka yako.

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:08.312
Kisha,niliporudi kufanya kazi muda wote,

00:04:08.312 --> 00:04:11.601
katika jukumu hili,niliungana na washiriki wenzangu walio bora

00:04:11.601 --> 00:04:15.093
ambao pia walikuwa na hamu ya majibu ya haya maswali.

00:04:15.093 --> 00:04:18.038
Sasa,katika haya yote,nilichambua

00:04:18.038 --> 00:04:22.042
tabia za viongozi wanaofanikiwa sana

00:04:22.042 --> 00:04:23.868
na kujua kipi cha tofauti wanachofanya,

00:04:23.868 --> 00:04:26.321
na pia nikachambua

00:04:26.321 --> 00:04:29.263
maandalizi yanayowezesha watu

00:04:29.263 --> 00:04:31.904
kukuza uwezo wao.